marketaxess-mktx-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[0,0,0,0.0],"dtc":[0,0,0,0.0],"ai_spend":[0,0,0,0.0],"tariffs":[0,0,0,0.0],"pricing_power":[1,0,1,1.26],"cost_cuts":[0,0,0,0.0],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":-0.0031,"r5":0.0898,"r20":0.143,"r1_spy":-0.0223,"r5_spy":0.0845,"r20_spy":0.1507}},{"id":"MKTX 2026 Q1","t":"MKTX","d":"2026-05-07","time":"10:00","w":7602,"n":25,"url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/01/marketaxess-mktx-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[1,0,1,1.33],"dtc":[0,0,0,0.0],"ai_spend":[1,0,1,1.33],"tariffs":[1,0,1,1.33],"pricing_power":[0,0,0,0.0],"cost_cuts":[1,0,1,1.33],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":0.0257,"r5":-0.0642,"r20":-0.1896,"r1_spy":0.0287,"r5_spy":-0.0758,"r20_spy":-0.2213}}],"quotes":[{"c":"MKTX 2018 Q3","e":"mktx","d":"2018-10-24","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Richard McVey","x":"I mean we have the technology capabilities to operate streaming price markets already which we do in CDS indices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/24/marketaxess-holdings-inc-mktx-q3-2018-earnings-con.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2018 Q3","e":"mktx","d":"2018-10-24","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Richard McVey","x":"So the technology series, it's a question really of what do the streaming price quotes look like relative to what institutional investors are able to achieve through an RFQ.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/24/marketaxess-holdings-inc-mktx-q3-2018-earnings-con.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2018 Q3","e":"mktx","d":"2018-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard McVey","x":"Participants benefited from average transaction cost savings of approximately 1.9 basis points of yield when they completed a US high-grade transaction through open trading protocols.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/24/marketaxess-holdings-inc-mktx-q3-2018-earnings-con.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2018 Q4","e":"mktx","d":"2019-01-30","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Richard M. McVey","x":"But there are two places, where I think faster protocols including streaming protocols make a lot of sense.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/30/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q4-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2018 Q4","e":"mktx","d":"2019-01-30","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Richard M. McVey","x":"And as you know, we don't participate all that actively on the first week or so of trading following new issues, and we do think that there are ways for us to participate more fully through quicker and -- protocols and streaming prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/30/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q4-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2018 Q4","e":"mktx","d":"2019-01-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Christopher R. Concannon","x":"…and liquidity, which is a key factor in the cost of trading a fixed income instrument, so that the more we can distribute that data the more we can -- it's not just a price increase game, it's also a distribution and being smart around the data that we are sharing or haven't shared just yet.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/30/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q4-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2018 Q4","e":"mktx","d":"2019-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard M. McVey","x":"This significant increase in client and dealer trading activity translated into increased transaction cost savings for market participants.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/30/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q4-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2018 Q4","e":"mktx","d":"2019-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard M. McVey","x":"Participants benefited from average transaction cost savings of approximately 2.5 basis points in yield when they completed a US high-grade transaction through Open Trading protocols.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/30/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q4-2018-earnings-conf.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2019 Q1","e":"mktx","d":"2019-04-24","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Patrick O'Shaughnessy","x":"In other -- I'll just stick on asset classes, I think in particular treasuries, we've seen aggregated streaming providers like LiquidityEdge really start to make some inroads.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/24/marketaxess-holdings-inc-mktx-q1-2019-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2019 Q1","e":"mktx","d":"2019-04-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard M. McVey","x":"Participants benefited from average transaction cost savings of approximately 2.6 basis points in yield when they completed a U.S. high-grade transaction through Open Trading protocols.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/24/marketaxess-holdings-inc-mktx-q1-2019-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2019 Q2","e":"mktx","d":"2019-07-24","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Chris Concannon","x":"Live markets is an all to all live order book with streaming dealer liquidity that was developed for the institutional market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/24/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2019 Q2","e":"mktx","d":"2019-07-24","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Rick McVey","x":"Live markets is not designed to compete with the banks, It's actually designed to help the banks provide what they've built on their side, which is streaming liquidity, streaming dealer liquidity, we're seeing it today in response to RFQs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/24/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2019 Q2","e":"mktx","d":"2019-07-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rick McVey","x":"Participants benefited from average transaction cost savings of approximate 2.4 basis points in yield, when they completed in the US high-grade transaction through Open Trading protocols.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/24/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2019 Q2","e":"mktx","d":"2019-07-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rick McVey","x":"This is the 3rd quarter in a row where we have delivered estimated total transaction cost savings to our clients of around $100 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/24/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2019 Q3","e":"mktx","d":"2019-10-23","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Chris Concannon","x":"This acquisition brings streaming treasury liquidity and trading capabilities to MarketAxess.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/23/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2019 Q3","e":"mktx","d":"2019-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard M. McVey","x":"The combination of transaction cost savings and improved trading efficiency is the cornerstone of our value proposition for dealer and investor clients.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/23/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2019 Q3","e":"mktx","d":"2019-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Concannon","x":"Institutional investors and dealers are increasingly demanding trading tools that will allow them to work more efficiently, while achieving transaction cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/23/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2019 Q4","e":"mktx","d":"2020-01-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Chris Concannon","x":"We are now actively onboarding clients and dealers to build a robust streaming liquidity solution.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2019 Q4","e":"mktx","d":"2020-01-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Chris Concannon","x":"More importantly, our dealer-to-client integration, where we actually allow our institutional clients from the MarketAxess platform to access dealer streaming liquidity, we expect that to be launched in the second half of 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2019 Q4","e":"mktx","d":"2020-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard M. McVey","x":"For the full-year 2019, Open Trading price improvements delivered estimated transaction cost savings of $385 million to our clients.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2019 Q4","e":"mktx","d":"2020-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Concannon","x":"Open Trading also continues to deliver significant transaction cost savings for participants with an estimated $79 million in aggregate savings in the fourth quarter for both liquidity providers and liquidity takers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2020 Q1","e":"mktx","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard M. McVey","x":"As price dispersion in credit markets exploded in March, open trading delivered sharply higher transaction cost savings to clients.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2020 Q1","e":"mktx","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard M. McVey","x":"Estimated client transaction cost savings on the trading system exceeded company revenues for the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2020 Q2","e":"mktx","d":"2020-07-22","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Chris Concannon","x":"So we're pretty excited about the dealer feedback on the dealer direct streaming tool.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/22/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2020 Q2","e":"mktx","d":"2020-07-22","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Chris Concannon","x":"What's great about it is it allows dealers to customize streaming liquidity direct to a disclosed client.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/22/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2020 Q2","e":"mktx","d":"2020-07-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard M. McVey","x":"With significantly higher volatility and price dispersion during the quarter, Open Trading estimated transaction cost savings reached a new record of $312 million exceeding company revenues for the second quarter in a row.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/22/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2020 Q2","e":"mktx","d":"2020-07-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard M. McVey","x":"The value proposition to our clients has never been more clear as we deliver substantial transaction cost savings, essential new market liquidity, and greater trading efficiency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/22/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"MKTX 2020 Q3","e":"mktx","d":"2020-10-27","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Chris Concannon","x":"We announced last week a commitment from Goldman Sachs to provide streaming firm prices for U.S. investment-grade credit into our live markets order book.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"MKTX 2020 Q3","e":"mktx","d":"2020-10-27","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Chris Concannon","x":"We also expect to launch our new fully integrated streaming click-to-trade rates front end within the MarketAxess workstation this quarter, allowing thousands of current credit trading users to access our rates trading solution.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"MKTX 2020 Q3","e":"mktx","d":"2020-10-27","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Antonio L. DeLise","x":"And also, we're putting money at use to facilitate trading at DTC.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"MKTX 2020 Q3","e":"mktx","d":"2020-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard M. McVey","x":"Open Trading volume was up 41% year-over-year, driving estimated client transaction cost savings of over $250 million for the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"MKTX 2020 Q3","e":"mktx","d":"2020-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard M. McVey","x":"For the third quarter in a row, estimated transaction cost savings of $252 million delivered to our clients, exceed company revenues.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"MKTX 2020 Q4","e":"mktx","d":"2021-01-27","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Rick McVey","x":"And more importantly, our very unique off the run streaming solution, which really no other platforms have streaming off the runs to institutional clients.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/27/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"MKTX 2020 Q4","e":"mktx","d":"2021-01-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rick McVey","x":"Open Trading volume grew 63% to $218 billion in the fourth quarter, driving estimated transaction cost savings of $225 million to our clients.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/27/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"MKTX 2020 Q4","e":"mktx","d":"2021-01-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rick McVey","x":"Estimated transaction cost savings from Open Trading skyrocketed to $1.1 billion for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/27/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"MKTX 2021 Q1","e":"mktx","d":"2021-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard M. McVey","x":"Open Trading volumes grew 20% year-over-year and estimated transaction cost savings delivered to our clients were $197 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"MKTX 2021 Q1","e":"mktx","d":"2021-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard M. McVey","x":"For the fifth quarter in a row estimated transaction cost savings of $197 million delivered to our clients were in excess of total company credit trading revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/22/marketaxess-holding-inc-mktx-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"MKTX 2021 Q2","e":"mktx","d":"2021-07-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard M. McVey","x":"Our unique Open Trading liquidity pool continues to drive important transaction cost savings to our clients, in spite of the low-volatility environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/21/marketaxess-holdings-inc-mktx-q2-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"MKTX 2021 Q3","e":"mktx","d":"2021-10-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Concannon","x":"The increased diversity of participation continues to drive cost saving opportunities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/20/marketaxess-holdings-inc-mktx-q3-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"MKTX 2021 Q3","e":"mktx","d":"2021-10-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Christopher N. Gerosa","x":"The 32% decline in clearing costs reflect transaction cost savings from our strategic decision to convert to a self-clearing model back in August 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/20/marketaxess-holdings-inc-mktx-q3-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"MKTX 2021 Q3","e":"mktx","d":"2021-10-20","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Christopher N. Gerosa","x":"So I don't think the fact that we reduced our 2021 guidance has nothing to do with levering back on those investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/20/marketaxess-holdings-inc-mktx-q3-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"MKTX 2025 Q4","e":"mktx","d":"2026-02-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Christopher Concannon","x":"We have a number of protocols that are seeing block volume pass through it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/06/marketaxess-mktx-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MKTX 2026 Q1","e":"mktx","d":"2026-05-07","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Christopher Concannon","x":"That allows us to trade directly on the break using access from dealers, streaming price and a click-to-trade solution.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/01/marketaxess-mktx-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MKTX 2026 Q1","e":"mktx","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Christopher Concannon","x":"So also the other opportunity that we have is we've been investing heavily in AI when it comes to our date for a number of years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/01/marketaxess-mktx-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MKTX 2026 Q1","e":"mktx","d":"2026-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Christopher Concannon","x":"And then as you mentioned, it was obviously a very dif